    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but thats the problem isnt it? being \"valued\" is just another way of saying i am useful. i am valued because i perform. i am valued because i provide output. if i stop being useful, the value disappears, and i am just... nothing. it feels like the only way to actually be \"me\" and not just a resource for them is to stop being a resource entirely. to just stop.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
